      "loss_type": "nll",
      "model_str": "GPR(\n  (likelihood): LogGaussianLikelihood(\n    (noise_covar): LogScaleHomoskedasticNoise(\n      (raw_noise_constraint): SoftClamp(-7, -1, margin=0.01)\n    )\n  )\n  (mean_module): ConstantMean()\n  (covar_module): LogScaleKernel(\n    (base_kernel): PowerExponentialKernel(\n      (raw_lengthscale_constraint): SoftClamp(-6, 3, margin=0.01)\n      (raw_power_constraint): Interval(1.000E+00, 2.000E+00)\n    )\n    (raw_outputscale_constraint): SoftClamp(-5, 4, margin=0.01)\n  )\n)",
